Package: BCQRF
Title: Bayesian Constrained Quantile Regression Forest for Soil Property Prediction
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("J.J.", "Maynard", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A soil-science research project that predicts soil properties
    (e.g. clay content) by combining SSURGO, SOLUS, SoilGrids, and KSSL data
    sources with Monte Carlo simulation of correlated soil properties and
    Bayesian updating to constrain quantile regression forest predictions.
    Includes a Coweeta Hydrologic Laboratory watershed case study. This is
    not built or distributed as an installable R package; DESCRIPTION is kept
    as an informal project manifest.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://github.com/jjmaynard/BCQRF
BugReports: https://github.com/jjmaynard/BCQRF/issues
